  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bring Palliative Care to Lebanese Cancer Patients</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is the first HBPC program in North Lebanon. It provides holistic home-based hospice care to chronically ill patients in the absence of medical coverage to ill patients. Sanabel has a trained medical team in palliative care that allows them to provide a wide range of medical services including medication expense coverage, equipment for promoting quality of life, psychological support, including services aiming to preserve patient&apos;s dignity in their own home surrounded by loved ones.</narrative>
  </description>
